1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
One cocoon unwinds into 900 metres of silk thread.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,800
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,400
China hid how to make it for millennia.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,000
Smuggling a silkworm out? Punishable by death.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,800
Double-tap if you'd wear real Chinese silk.

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,400
It took about 2,000 cocoons to weave one dress.

7
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,200
Two monks finally smuggled eggs out in bamboo canes.

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,600
★ Expert Tip: see live silkworms at Suzhou's silk museum.

9
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,600
Silk or gold — which was worth more? Tell me below.
